{"2009100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Immortals of Aveum™", "steam_appid": 2009100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2165170], "detailed_description": "<h1>Immortals of Aveum™ Deluxe Edition</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009100/extras/4d9bb3205438f852c66db48b39265f17.avif?t=1777395412\" width=610 height=712 /></span><br>Purchase Immortals of Aveum™ Deluxe Edition and get the Ancient Relics of Aveum Pack, containing:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Triarch’s Wrath — can be equipped as either Jak’s red, green or blue sigil and boosts critical hit damage<br></li><li>Immortals Ring — increases Shred against all 3 colors of magic<br></li><li>Ring of Rasharn — increases spell damage for all 3 colors of magic<br></li><li>Aristeyan Ring — boosts Fury damage for all 3 colors of magic<br></li><li>Bracer of the Colossal — bestows increased Armor and Healing Crystal recovery<br></li><li>Sky Island Gauntlet — increases Armor and Shield Health, while decreasing Dodge cooldown<br></li><li>Dresnyr Lens — increases Spellbreak damage and boosts the overall power of red magic spells<br></li><li>Lucian Chain — increases the overall power of blue magic and decreases the cooldown of Lash control spells<br></li><li>Vial of the Pentacade — increases the duration of Limpet control spells and boosts overall green magic power</li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009100/extras/a182ea59c9f6ae7b02691e35e6648807.poster.avif?t=1777395412\" width=610 height=3114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2009100/extras/a182ea59c9f6ae7b02691e35e6648807.webm?t=1777395412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st